<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Aggiornamento di stato del Ticket</title>

    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Syne:wght@700&family=Manrope:wght@400;600&display=swap"
        rel="stylesheet">
</head>

<body
    style="font-family: 'Manrope', Arial, sans-serif; background-color: #F6F5F1; margin: 0; padding: 40px 20px; color: #1C1B16;">

    <!-- blocco a 600px -->
    <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
        style="max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; background-color: #ffffff; border-radius: 14px; border: 1px solid #E3E1DB; overflow: hidden; border-collapse: collapse;">


        <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #2058E8; padding: 24px; text-align: center;">
                <h1
                    style="font-family: 'Syne', Arial, sans-serif; color: #ffffff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; font-weight: 700;">
                    HelpDesk</h1>
            </td>
        </tr>


        <tr>
            <td style="padding: 32px 24px;">
                <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px;">Ciao <strong>
                        <%= userName %>
                    </strong>,</p>


                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                    style="margin-bottom: 24px; background-color: #FAFAF8; border: 1px solid #E3E1DB; border-radius: 8px;">
                    <tr>
                        <td style="padding: 16px;">
                            <p
                                style="margin: 0 0 4px 0; font-size: 13px; color: #68665D; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
                                Ticket #<%= ticketId %>
                            </p>
                            <p
                                style="margin: 0; font-size: 16px; color: #1C1B16; font-weight: 700; font-family: 'Syne', Arial, sans-serif;">
                                <%= ticketTitle %>
                            </p>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>


                <p style="font-size: 16px; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 24px; line-height: 1.5;">
                    C'è un aggiornamento per te. L'operatore <strong>
                        <%= operatorName %>
                    </strong> ha modificato lo stato della tua richiesta:
                </p>


                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0"
                    style="margin-bottom: 32px; border-top: 1px dashed #C9C7BF; border-bottom: 1px dashed #C9C7BF;">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center" style="padding: 24px 0;">

                            <!-- uso una table inline per centrare i badge di stato -->
                            <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin: 0 auto;">
                                <tr>

                                    <td align="center"
                                        style="background-color: <%= oldStatusBg || '#EDECEA' %>; border: 1px solid <%= oldStatusBorder || '#EDECEA' %>; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 6px;">
                                        <span
                                            style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: <%= oldStatusText || '#68665D' %>; text-transform: uppercase;">
                                            <%= oldStatus %>
                                        </span>
                                    </td>


                                    <td align="center" style="padding: 0 16px;">
                                        <span style="font-size: 18px; color: #9C9A90; font-weight: bold;">&rarr;</span>
                                    </td>

                                    <!-- colori e testi dinamici da nodejs con fallback di sicurezza -->
                                    <td align="center"
                                        style="background-color: <%= newStatusBg || '#EBF0FF' %>; border: 1px solid <%= newStatusBorder || '#93AEFF' %>; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 6px;">
                                        <span
                                            style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; color: <%= newStatusText || '#1848CC' %>; text-transform: uppercase;">
                                            <%= newStatus %>
                                        </span>
                                    </td>
                                </tr>
                            </table>

                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>


                <table width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0">
                    <tr>
                        <td align="center">
                            <a href="<%= ticketUrl %>"
                                style="font-family: 'Manrope', Arial, sans-serif; display: inline-block; background-color: #2058E8; color: #ffffff; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 28px; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px;">Visualizza
                                il ticket</a>
                        </td>
                    </tr>
                </table>
            </td>
        </tr>


        <tr>
            <td style="background-color: #FAFAF8; padding: 24px; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #E3E1DB;">
                <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 13px; color: #9C9A90; line-height: 1.5;">
                    Hai ricevuto questa email perché sei iscritto alle notifiche di HelpDesk.<br>
                    Non rispondere direttamente a questa email.
                </p>
            </td>
        </tr>

    </table>

</body>

</html>